type: software
title: "LearnedFP - Artifact"
abstract: >-
  Source code for "When Tracking Learns: Learning-Based Browser
  Fingerprinting Under Anti-Fingerprinting Defenses." Includes the
  collection framework, lab samples, evaluation pipeline,
  metadata-consistency check, defense-detection probe, Web Audio
  experiment, mitigation-prototype browser extension, and the code
  used to run and evaluate the DRAWNAPART and FingerprintJS baselines.
